<title>MEXICO: Autlan says to gain from debt prepayment.</title>
<headline>Autlan says to gain from debt prepayment.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican mining company Compania Minera Autlan said on Wednesday it would reap a benefit of 38 million pesos in the first quarter of 1997 as a result of prepaying a debt of $12.07 million with the Mexican development bank Nacional Financiera (Nafin).</p>
<p>The company said in a news release it would save 38 million pesos on interest payments no longer required since the company prepaid its debt with Nafin on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;The debt prepayment ... will result in a benefit of 38 million peosos for first-quarter results,&quot; the statement said.</p>
<p>((--Veronica Galan, Mexico City newsroom, +525 728-9553))</p>
